  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひとと　かかわることなく　いのちを　おとしたのらの　いぬポケモンがうまれかわったと　いわれている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "사람과의 접점 없이 숨을 거둔 들개포켓몬이 환생한 것으로 여겨지고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "據說牠是不曾接觸過人類就死去的流浪犬寶可夢轉生而來的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On pense qu’il est la réincarnation d’un Pokémon chien errant qui a perdu la vie sans jamais avoir eu d’interaction avec les êtres humains.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es soll die Wiedergeburt eines streunenden Hunde-Pokémon sein, das starb, ohne je in Berührung mit Menschen gekommen zu sein.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se cree que es la reencarnación de un Pokémon perro vagabundo que murió sin haber tenido contacto con humanos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si dice sia rinato da un Pokémon canide selvatico che ha perso la vita senza aver mai avuto contatti con gli esseri umani.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It is said that a dog Pokémon that died in the wild without ever interacting with a human was reborn as this Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "人と　関わることなく　命を　落とした野良の　犬ポケモンが生まれ変わったと　言われている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "据说它是由还未接触人类就去世的流浪犬宝可梦转生而来的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se cree que es la reencarnación de un Pokémon perro vagabundo que murió sin haber tenido contacto con humanos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひとなつっこくて　さびしがり。ちょっと　かまっただけでもいつまでも　あとを　ついてくるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "사람을 잘 따르며 외로움을 잘 탄다. 조금만 관심을 줘도 끝없이 뒤를 따라다닌다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "愛親近人，害怕寂寞。就算只跟牠玩了一下下，牠也會一直跟在後面。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est sociable et n’aime pas la solitude. Une fois qu’une personne lui accorde la moindre attention, il ne la quitte plus d’une semelle.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses anhängliche Pokémon ist nicht gern allein. Auch wenn man sich nur kurz um es kümmert, läuft es einem auf ewig nach.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon muy afable que no soporta la soledad. Seguirá para siempre a quien le dé una mínima muestra de atención.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Soffre la solitudine e si affeziona facilmente. Se qualcuno gli rivolge anche la più piccola attenzione, inizia a seguirlo ovunque vada.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This friendly Pokémon doesn’t like being alone. Pay it even the slightest bit of attention, and it will follow you forever.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "人懐っこくて　寂しがり。ちょっと　かまっただけでもいつまでも　後を　ついてくるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "爱亲近人，害怕寂寞。即使只和它玩了一小会儿，它也会一直跟在身后。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
